=== pharmacy ===
The night store is too bright for the hour. The pharmacy counter inside the night store sees everything except faces when it matters. A green stamp marks each paper bag.

* [Ask about the paper bag]
    The pharmacist remembers Arin carrying a white paper bag with a green stamp, left hand, phone in the right, at 19:04.
    -> pharmacy
* [Ask about the purchase]
    Aconite tincture was logged at 19:04 at the night-store pharmacy counter. The receipt has no cough drops on it.
    -> pharmacy
* [Read the camera note]
    The night-store camera records the purchase, the bag, and the time. It does not record what Arin did after he left the counter.
    -> pharmacy
* [Leave]
    -> END
